  "title": "Bondada’s Solar IPP Arm Secures ₹9.11 Billion for 225 MW Solar Project",
  "summary": "Onix IPP, a subsidiary of Bondada Engineering (BEL), has secured ₹9.11 billion (~$94.96 million) in financing from the State Bank of India for a 225 MW solar power project in Maharashtra. The approved funds include ₹9 billion (~$93.79 million) in term loan facilities and ₹112.5 million (~$1.17 million) in non-fund-based facilities.",
